# L §2.5 (round 12): a written key at a stepped range's position that isn't one of its values is refused (LOAD-KEY):
# 2026-01-09 is not 2026-01-01 + 7·i. (Was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §2.5, writer 5's T-5.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
input r[d in 2026-01-01 .. 2026-12-31 step 7 days]: int

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  r[2026-01-09] = 1 "s"
  r[*] = 0 "s"

ask q: r[2026-01-15]
ask q2: sum(r[d] for d in 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31 step 7 days)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-KEY 2026-01-09 is not a value of 2026-01-01 .. 2026-12-31 step 7 day (m.tally:15)
